  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Weapons</p>\n<p><em>Never risk losing your most preem gear again.</em></p>\n<p>Attaching this attachment requires a DV17 Electronics/Security Tech Skill Check. Only one Biometric Lock may be installed. A biometric lock (typically a thumbprint scanner) is installed that prevents the weapon and any of its features from being used by any unauthorized user.</p>\n<p>For firearms, this prevents unloading the weapon. For melee weapons, this does not prevent the weapon itself from being used, but does prevent any of its special features from functioning. Bypassing the Biometric Lock requires beating a DV17 Electronics/Security Tech Check and 1 minute. For weapons that already possess a biometric system of some kind, this attachment instead improves the existing biometric system to require a DV24 Electronics/Security Tech Check to bypass, and anyone whom attempts to use the weapon without a valid biometric key is hit as if struck by a Stun Baton to their body.</p>\n<p><em>NOTE: Credit to the Cyberpunk RUSH LC for the inspiration of this item.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Grips &amp; Controls).</em></p>"
